		(title "VMT 04/16 controller - Status Inputs")
		(date "2026-11-03")
		(rev "0.1")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Status Inputs\n24 V -> 3V3 optocoupler inputs for everything the MCU reads from the power side."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "237924b0-2b06-4a54-94be-9ae9665d8916")
	)
	(text_box "TO DESIGN\n- 8 inputs from the 24 V side -> 3V3 logic for the MCU: 6 fault relay states (STAT_*), COOL_IDLE (1K4 NC) and Y2_STATE (1K15).\n- 24 V = OK / active -> opto on -> output pulled low (invert in firmware).\n- Input: series resistor for ~3 mA at 24 V, reverse diode across the LED, threshold such that < ~10 V reads as off.\n- Output: open collector with pull-up to +3V3, small RC against relay contact bounce.\n- Grounds are common (L- = GND), so the optos are for noise immunity, not galvanic isolation.\n\nCOMPONENT PROPOSAL\n- 2x Toshiba TLP291-4 (4-channel phototransistor opto, SOP-16).\n- Input resistor 6.8k 0.25 W (~3.3 mA at 24 V), reverse diode 1N4148W, pull-up 10k, RC 1k / 100 nF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 50.8 0)
